CLI.md §3.4 "Absent roots", CODEGEN.md §2.4, §2.9 (DECISIONS 332): the outputs under the optional root @src, absent here, are skipped, not listed and counted in one W8024; the rest is written, and canon.outputs keeps the skipped text files' lines.
